# Copy this file to .env and fill in a real TMDB API key (v3 auth "API Key", not the v4
# "Read Access Token") from https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api - it's free and
# instant. Baked into the client build by Vite (see src/card/logic/tmdb.js); used to look
# up a movie/show's YouTube trailer id when Plex doesn't already have one hosted as an
# extra. Without this set, trailer lookups just silently skip the TMDB fallback.
VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=
